WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:02.230
Stocking up on books?

00:02.230 --> 00:04.810
Yeah. Moon Reader got a request for some.

00:05.270 --> 00:07.540
The books from the Regulus Empire, right?

00:07.540 --> 00:12.380
Yeah. It's my first time going there, 
so I got the memory from Lapis-san.

00:12.380 --> 00:14.240
What are you doing after this, Linze?

00:14.240 --> 00:16.990
I plan to read for a little longer.

00:16.990 --> 00:20.950
I feel like you're always in Moon Reader now.

00:20.950 --> 00:24.570
Really? I feel like I could 
be reading even more.

00:24.570 --> 00:25.880
You could read even more?

00:25.880 --> 00:28.760
Don't get too engrossed in it, okay?

00:28.760 --> 00:29.750
Sure!

00:29.750 --> 00:30.970
All right!

00:30.970 --> 00:33.470
Time for a quick trip to buy some books, then!

02:03.970 --> 02:08.980
Episode 4

02:03.970 --> 02:08.980
Upheaval in the Capital and an Imperial Princess

02:12.820 --> 02:14.920
Wh-What's all this?

02:14.920 --> 02:16.080
A fire?

02:16.080 --> 02:17.830
No, this is no ordinary fire.

02:17.830 --> 02:19.150
What's going on?

02:20.410 --> 02:21.580
Gravity!

02:22.870 --> 02:23.920
Boost!

02:28.840 --> 02:33.450
<i>Logan-san mentioned before that there were 
strange movements in the Empire recently.</i>

02:33.790 --> 02:37.010
<i>He was talking about them 
strengthening their military,</i>

02:37.010 --> 02:38.990
<i>but I didn't think it would lead to this...</i>

02:43.760 --> 02:45.260
You're safe now!

02:45.260 --> 02:48.480
I shot him with a paralyzing bullet, 
so he won't be able to move for a while.

02:49.410 --> 02:51.440
What on earth is going on here?

02:52.230 --> 02:53.290
We need to treat you!

02:53.290 --> 02:54.210
The army...

02:54.210 --> 02:55.130
Huh?

02:55.130 --> 02:57.150
The army is revolting...

02:57.150 --> 02:58.440
<i>Revolting?</i>

02:58.440 --> 03:01.110
<i>Meaning... this is a coup d'état?!</i>

03:05.420 --> 03:07.730
I treated his wounds with healing magic,

03:07.730 --> 03:10.040
so he should be safe if stays hidden in here.

03:13.020 --> 03:15.800
<i>For now, I should find the emperor 
and help him escape with Gate.</i>

03:15.800 --> 03:19.630
<i>Maybe the fighting will settle down 
once there's no one for them to defeat.</i>

03:24.140 --> 03:27.540
I have no idea where the 
emperor's room is, though.

03:34.350 --> 03:35.240
Search!

03:35.240 --> 03:40.190
A girl, and someone trying to 
harm her, within a 100-meter radius!

03:40.680 --> 03:43.250
Search complete. Displaying.

03:44.160 --> 03:45.310
This way?

03:55.070 --> 03:56.210
Are you okay?!

03:58.630 --> 04:00.170
Y-Yes.

04:00.510 --> 04:02.010
Let's heal you first.

04:02.010 --> 04:03.080
Huh?

04:03.080 --> 04:04.450
Come forth, Light.

04:04.450 --> 04:07.170
Soothing Comfort: Cure Heal.

04:09.120 --> 04:12.640
<i>She must have been terribly 
frightened, to be shaking so much.</i>

04:16.710 --> 04:18.200
You'll be all right now.

04:20.600 --> 04:21.510
Uh...

04:22.150 --> 04:24.270
I-It's nothing!

04:24.270 --> 04:28.610
I-I've just never had much 
contact with men before,

04:28.610 --> 04:31.120
s-s-so I was a little nervous.

04:31.120 --> 04:32.280
Princess!

04:33.510 --> 04:34.560
Carol!

04:34.920 --> 04:36.510
You're safe?

04:36.510 --> 04:37.420
Yes.

04:37.420 --> 04:40.760
This man rescued me when I was in danger.

04:40.760 --> 04:41.880
And you are...

04:42.230 --> 04:44.590
I'm an adventurer from Belfast.

04:44.590 --> 04:48.110
I used teleportation magic to visit 
the Empire so I could buy some things,

04:48.110 --> 04:50.180
and I ran into this commotion.

04:51.070 --> 04:52.930
You can use teleportation magic?!

04:54.270 --> 04:55.730
Then I beg of you!

04:56.120 --> 04:58.040
Please teleport the emperor, prince,

04:58.040 --> 05:00.820
and princess to safety!

05:00.820 --> 05:02.180
S-Sure.

05:02.180 --> 05:03.490
You will?!

05:03.490 --> 05:06.410
Yeah, that was my plan to begin with.

05:06.990 --> 05:09.610
I apologize for losing my composure.

05:09.610 --> 05:11.880
I am Caroline Rillettes,

05:11.880 --> 05:14.600
a knight of the Empire's 3rd order.

05:14.600 --> 05:16.370
Please call me Carol.

05:17.980 --> 05:23.340
I am the third princess of the Regulus 
Empire, Lucia Rea Regulus.

05:23.340 --> 05:26.460
I'm Mochizuki Touya. Nice to meet you.

05:26.460 --> 05:28.530
Mochizuki Touya...

05:28.530 --> 05:29.620
What should we do?

05:29.620 --> 05:31.930
Shall I get Princess Lucia to safety first?

05:31.930 --> 05:33.840
Yes, please do.

05:33.840 --> 05:36.270
No, that can come later.

05:36.270 --> 05:38.190
Touya, please.

05:38.190 --> 05:42.230
Please save my father and 
older brother before me.

05:43.000 --> 05:45.070
All right, but...

05:45.450 --> 05:49.780
<i>The chances that the emperor and 
prince are safe in this situation are...</i>

05:51.500 --> 05:53.200
I'm prepared for the worst.

05:53.200 --> 05:54.400
Even so...

05:54.400 --> 05:57.340
I can't escape on my own before them.

05:57.340 --> 06:00.500
Please take me to my father and older brother.

06:01.170 --> 06:03.460
All right. Let's go.

06:03.900 --> 06:05.720
I'll lead the way.

06:08.720 --> 06:10.110
It's through there?

06:10.110 --> 06:13.220
Yes. That's the emperor's bedchamber.

06:20.400 --> 06:21.860
Father!

06:21.860 --> 06:23.730
I guess we were too late?

06:25.440 --> 06:27.080
General Bazoar!

06:27.080 --> 06:30.200
What are you thinking, 
attacking His Imperial Majesty?!

06:30.580 --> 06:33.390
Princess Lucia and the Rillettes girl...

06:33.390 --> 06:35.080
So you're still alive?

06:35.080 --> 06:38.290
I might as well ask. Why are you doing this?

06:38.290 --> 06:40.290
Who are you?

06:40.290 --> 06:42.450
I'm an adventurer from Belfast.

06:42.450 --> 06:43.820
An outsider.

06:43.820 --> 06:45.460
I don't understand what's going on,

06:45.460 --> 06:48.370
so I haven't been able to 
decide if I should take a side.

06:48.370 --> 06:50.260
So please tell me why you're doing this.

06:50.260 --> 06:54.540
The emperor has fallen mentally ill.

06:54.540 --> 06:56.430
There has never been a better time

06:56.430 --> 07:00.290
to break our non-aggression 
treaty and invade Belfast,

07:00.290 --> 07:01.980
yet he still hesitates to do so.

07:01.980 --> 07:04.340
Break the non-aggression treaty?

07:04.340 --> 07:07.860
You mean you're taking over 
the country to try and start a war?

07:09.010 --> 07:10.780
And what if I am?

07:10.780 --> 07:15.750
Belfast has an alliance with its 
neighbors, Mismede and Refreese.

07:15.750 --> 07:17.620
You think you can beat all three nations?

07:17.620 --> 07:19.400
We can.

07:19.400 --> 07:23.220
Did you think we spent the last 
20 years twiddling our thumbs

07:23.220 --> 07:26.210
after signing that non-aggression treaty?

07:26.210 --> 07:28.050
<i>What's with his magic capacity?!</i>

07:28.050 --> 07:29.650
Come forth, Dark!

07:29.650 --> 07:33.180
I seek a prince of devils, Demon Lord!

07:45.840 --> 07:47.570
A-A devil!

07:48.000 --> 07:50.850
How were you able to forge a pact 
with such a powerful devil?

07:50.850 --> 07:52.400
Through sacrifices.

07:52.400 --> 07:56.490
I offered him living sacrifices from 
the criminals detained in the capital city.

07:56.490 --> 07:59.550
Then where does your exceptional 
magic power come from?

07:59.550 --> 08:01.160
Is that the work of the devil, too?

08:01.740 --> 08:03.350
My magic power comes from...

08:04.380 --> 08:05.540
An Artifact!

08:05.540 --> 08:07.790
This is the Bracelet of Absorption.

08:07.790 --> 08:10.760
It drains magic power from others.

08:10.760 --> 08:12.740
It drains magic power?

08:12.740 --> 08:15.340
So that's why my body has felt sluggish.

08:16.170 --> 08:17.180
My body is...

08:20.640 --> 08:21.880
This is bad.

08:21.880 --> 08:25.560
I could risk granting him even 
more magic power if I stay here.

08:26.220 --> 08:27.280
Apport!

08:28.380 --> 08:30.820
You still have magic power left?

08:31.130 --> 08:32.370
Why?

08:32.370 --> 08:33.900
Why didn't my spell work?

08:33.900 --> 08:37.080
One of that devil's unique 
traits is magic nullification.

08:37.080 --> 08:39.160
Magic attacks don't work on it.

08:39.160 --> 08:43.370
And the same unique trait lies within me,
 the one who forged a pact with it.

08:43.370 --> 08:45.930
That ability's gonna be a real pain.

08:45.930 --> 08:46.960
In that case...

08:48.630 --> 08:50.610
Too bad for you.

08:50.610 --> 08:54.380
You probably thought a direct attack 
would work if magic didn't,

08:54.380 --> 08:55.810
but it doesn't work like that.

08:55.810 --> 08:56.720
Another one?

08:56.720 --> 08:58.940
This is the Bulwark Bracelet.

08:58.940 --> 09:01.720
It protects me from all types 
of physical attacks.

09:02.080 --> 09:03.170
I see.

09:03.170 --> 09:05.640
You drain magic power with 
the Bracelet of Absorption,

09:05.640 --> 09:07.920
nullify physical attacks 
with the Bulwark Bracelet,

09:07.920 --> 09:12.610
and nullify magic attacks with the unique 
trait of your summoned Demon Lord.

09:12.610 --> 09:15.090
This is my invincible defense!

09:15.090 --> 09:19.120
There isn't a man alive 
with the ability to harm me!

09:19.120 --> 09:22.930
<i>I'm not one to talk, but 
that's way too overpowered!</i>

09:25.130 --> 09:26.190
<i>He's alive?</i>

09:26.990 --> 09:28.750
<i>We haven't found the prince yet...</i>

09:28.750 --> 09:31.800
<i>But saving lives takes priority here.</i>

09:31.800 --> 09:33.380
Open a Gate.

09:33.380 --> 09:37.740
Targets are the emperor, 
Princess Lucia, and Carol-san.

09:37.740 --> 09:39.510
Teleport them to my garden.

09:39.510 --> 09:40.510
Understood.

09:40.510 --> 09:42.560
Activating Gate.

09:44.680 --> 09:47.270
You can use teleportation magic?!

09:47.270 --> 09:48.650
Correct.

09:48.650 --> 09:50.650
I'll withdraw for today,

09:50.650 --> 09:53.150
but I promise things won't 
go as you've planned.

09:53.150 --> 09:54.330
Fool.

09:54.330 --> 09:59.130
I told you that no one can harm me 
so long as I have the Bulwark Bracelet.

09:59.130 --> 10:00.160
Slip!

10:07.920 --> 10:08.910
Well?

10:08.910 --> 10:12.460
I may not have harmed your body, 
but I harmed your pride, didn't I?

10:12.460 --> 10:14.480
Wh-What did you...

10:15.420 --> 10:18.000
<i>Of course, he'll stop it soon 
by absorbing the magic power</i>

10:18.000 --> 10:20.640
<i>from the floor with the 
Bracelet of Absorption.</i>

10:20.640 --> 10:22.260
Damn it!

10:22.600 --> 10:25.600
<i>I'll use illusion magic to leave him 
one more present before I go.</i>

10:25.600 --> 10:26.640
Mirage!

10:28.180 --> 10:29.560
What did you do this time?!

10:30.580 --> 10:32.200
Farewell, men!

10:32.200 --> 10:35.500
Soon, the iron hammer of Babylon 
will fall upon you all!

10:35.500 --> 10:37.870
Say your prayers as you wait 
for that moment to come!

10:43.860 --> 10:45.130
Bugs!

10:44.850 --> 10:47.530
Oh, man, I could get hooked on this.

10:45.130 --> 10:46.620
So many bugs!

10:47.530 --> 10:49.540
What is this?!

10:55.730 --> 10:58.090
I already used healing magic on the emperor.

10:58.420 --> 11:01.380
The doctor is taking a look at him now,

11:01.380 --> 11:03.430
but the rest is up to him.

11:03.430 --> 11:05.080
Good grief.

11:05.080 --> 11:08.780
Why do you always end up sticking 
your neck into such trouble?

11:08.780 --> 11:11.140
It's not like I wanted to 
stick my neck into this.

11:11.140 --> 11:14.110
I can't believe that was 
happening in the Empire.

11:14.110 --> 11:17.370
I ran a search, and there 
are over 10,000 soldiers,

11:17.370 --> 11:20.010
while there are only around 
1,000 imperial knights.

11:20.010 --> 11:21.820
Nearly ten times as many.

11:21.820 --> 11:24.470
This is a terrible situation.

11:24.470 --> 11:28.290
If the Empire uses that devil 
to attack Belfast...

11:28.290 --> 11:30.750
We need to do something 
about it before then.

11:30.750 --> 11:36.460
But there's nothing we can do if magic 
attacks and physical attacks won't work.

11:36.460 --> 11:39.860
Touya-dono, do you have any ideas?

11:39.860 --> 11:41.800
Yeah, I have one that might work.

11:43.680 --> 11:46.250
I'm not really into the idea 
of tormenting someone,

11:46.250 --> 11:48.010
but I guess there's no choice.

11:48.500 --> 11:49.590
Touya...

11:49.590 --> 11:51.880
You're plotting something 
evil again, aren't you?

11:50.970 --> 11:53.020
Huh? Huh?

11:51.880 --> 11:53.020
He is.

11:53.930 --> 11:56.860
They said there's no need to worry, 
as long as he keeps resting.

11:57.220 --> 11:59.260
That's great, right, Princess Lucia?

11:59.260 --> 12:02.670
Thank you so much. It is a great relief.

12:02.670 --> 12:04.290
U-Um...

12:04.820 --> 12:08.030
Would you please call me Lu?

12:08.420 --> 12:09.790
All right, Lu.

12:09.790 --> 12:10.870
Like that?

12:11.360 --> 12:13.830
Yes! That makes me so happy!

12:13.830 --> 12:14.980
Stare.

12:15.810 --> 12:18.040
You startled me, Yumina!

12:19.090 --> 12:21.330
It's a pleasure to meet you.

12:21.330 --> 12:23.310
I am Yumina Urnea Belfast,

12:23.310 --> 12:28.930
daughter of Tristwyn Urnes Belfast, 
King of the Kingdom of Belfast.

12:28.930 --> 12:31.280
P-Pleased to meet you.

12:31.280 --> 12:37.860
I am Lucia Rea Regulus, third daughter 
of Emperor Zephyrus Roa Regulus.

12:37.860 --> 12:39.810
You must have had a terrible time.

12:39.810 --> 12:41.360
I'm relieved to see you're safe.

12:41.360 --> 12:46.160
Yes, Touya came to my rescue and 
allowed me to escape this crisis.

12:46.160 --> 12:47.850
That's great to hear.

12:47.850 --> 12:50.990
It makes me happy as Touya's fiancée.

12:50.990 --> 12:53.590
Huh? Fiancée?

12:53.590 --> 12:55.460
I-I see...

12:55.460 --> 13:00.020
Yumina, I'm going to head to the castle 
now and give my report on the Empire.

13:00.020 --> 13:01.420
Understood.

13:03.610 --> 13:06.750
Lucia, you love Touya as well, don't you?

13:08.720 --> 13:11.500
Huh?! O-Of course not!

13:11.500 --> 13:15.230
Touya is the man who saved 
my life, nothing more!

13:15.230 --> 13:19.520
O-Of course, he is very handsome, and he's 
a wonderful, reliable person, in my opinion...

13:19.520 --> 13:21.200
But as I said, um...

13:21.200 --> 13:23.610
I'm not sure what to say...

13:24.820 --> 13:25.860
I understand!

13:25.860 --> 13:26.460
Huh?

13:26.460 --> 13:28.990
A single word is not enough 
to describe Touya's charm!

13:28.990 --> 13:31.730
I knew you and I would get along!

13:31.730 --> 13:33.160
Er, um...

13:33.160 --> 13:36.640
Lucia, I have some things to 
discuss with you regarding that.

13:36.640 --> 13:41.170
We would be getting in His Imperial
Majesty's way here, so let's talk in my room!

13:41.170 --> 13:44.160
So that's what's happening in the Empire...

13:44.160 --> 13:48.130
I didn't expect to receive both 
good and bad news today.

13:48.130 --> 13:49.070
Huh?

13:49.070 --> 13:52.570
Oh, Yumina will be getting 
a younger brother or sister.

13:52.570 --> 13:54.720
What?! Congratulations!

13:54.720 --> 13:57.180
I have mixed feelings about it.

13:57.180 --> 14:00.810
I was hoping that you would succeed me.

14:00.810 --> 14:03.080
No, no, if you have a boy,

14:03.080 --> 14:05.160
it's only right that he inherits the throne.

14:05.160 --> 14:09.780
Then if it's a girl, you 
would inherit it for me?

14:09.780 --> 14:11.660
No, that logic isn't right.

14:11.660 --> 14:13.860
Well, jokes aside,

14:13.860 --> 14:17.860
I understand your plan 
to defeat General Bazoar.

14:17.860 --> 14:21.430
I'm sorry to place this burden on you, 
but please proceed with it.

14:22.330 --> 14:23.300
Storage.

14:24.800 --> 14:27.060
Have you finished your preparations?

14:27.060 --> 14:27.760
Yeah.

14:27.760 --> 14:31.970
Both the Bracelet of Absorption 
and the Bulwark Bracelet, huh?

14:31.970 --> 14:34.280
Do those ring a bell?

14:34.280 --> 14:38.140
If I remember right, I believe there 
were Artifacts with those abilities

14:38.140 --> 14:40.440
in Babylon's Storehouse.

14:40.440 --> 14:41.930
What?!

14:41.930 --> 14:45.720
So... you're saying those bracelets 
leaked out of the Storehouse

14:45.720 --> 14:47.570
and ended up in the general's hands?

14:47.570 --> 14:48.680
Yes.

14:48.680 --> 14:52.770
I believe there's also a chance that many 
other items there fell down to the surface.

14:53.190 --> 14:54.100
Hold on.

14:54.100 --> 15:00.580
So the Immortal Gem that grants its owner 
Immortality and caused the stir in Eashen

15:00.990 --> 15:03.650
was also an artifact that 
leaked out of the Storehouse?!

15:03.650 --> 15:07.690
Yeah, I do think there was something 
like that in the Storehouse.

15:07.690 --> 15:08.470
I knew it.

15:08.470 --> 15:12.300
The administrator of the Storehouse 
is a clumsy, careless woman.

15:13.210 --> 15:14.300
Touya!

15:14.300 --> 15:15.760
My father!

15:15.760 --> 15:18.290
He woke up moments ago.

15:18.290 --> 15:19.730
That's great.

15:19.730 --> 15:22.200
So you are Mochizuki Touya?

15:22.200 --> 15:23.200
Yes.

15:23.200 --> 15:28.690
I cannot show enough gratitude to you 
for saving my life and Lucia's.

15:28.690 --> 15:30.350
Please don't worry about it.

15:30.350 --> 15:33.450
I just happened to be in the 
capital city to do some shopping.

15:33.450 --> 15:35.850
It's a relief to hear you say that.

15:35.850 --> 15:39.330
This uprising was brought 
about by my own weakness.

15:39.330 --> 15:41.160
It's truly vexing.

15:41.160 --> 15:44.080
So... what will you do now?

15:44.080 --> 15:46.560
I must defeat General Bazoar.

15:46.560 --> 15:48.920
I'll need to devise a plan as soon as possible.

15:48.920 --> 15:52.180
It's possible for me to reclaim 
the capital as early as tomorrow.

15:53.920 --> 15:55.800
Impressive, Touya.

15:55.800 --> 15:57.830
Um, Touya?

15:58.660 --> 16:00.120
What is it, Lu?

16:00.120 --> 16:02.730
Before you handle General Bazoar,

16:02.730 --> 16:05.190
could you look for my older brother?

16:05.190 --> 16:06.680
The prince?

16:06.680 --> 16:09.520
If we could at least find out 
whether he's alive or not...

16:09.520 --> 16:11.280
Well, it's not impossible...

16:11.680 --> 16:13.910
Does the prince have any 
unique characteristics?

16:13.910 --> 16:16.110
Unique characteristics?

16:16.110 --> 16:20.390
Uh, he has silver hair, and, um... well...

16:20.390 --> 16:22.120
Unique, unique...

16:22.590 --> 16:24.650
<i>He really doesn't have any unique traits, huh?</i>

16:24.650 --> 16:26.710
Lu, hold out your hand for a moment.

16:26.970 --> 16:28.790
O-Okay.

16:30.170 --> 16:33.680
Close your eyes and think 
of your older brother.

16:33.680 --> 16:35.360
Picture how he looked most recently.

16:35.360 --> 16:36.900
O-Okay.

16:38.740 --> 16:39.870
Focus.

16:39.870 --> 16:41.140
O-Okay!

16:41.140 --> 16:42.260
Recall.

16:44.140 --> 16:44.850
Huh?

16:44.850 --> 16:46.930
I-Is something the matter?

16:47.390 --> 16:50.580
I've met this man before.

16:50.580 --> 16:51.320
Huh?

16:51.320 --> 16:53.590
Oh, crap. I left him behind.

16:53.590 --> 16:54.490
What?!

16:54.490 --> 16:57.290
Hey, I didn't think he 
could possibly be the prince!

16:57.290 --> 16:58.630
S-Search.

16:58.630 --> 17:00.160
The imperial prince.

17:00.160 --> 17:01.070
Understood.

17:01.070 --> 17:02.630
Search complete.

17:02.630 --> 17:03.940
Displaying now.

17:05.370 --> 17:06.710
We have his location.

17:08.210 --> 17:09.670
Wh-What is this?

17:09.670 --> 17:11.770
It's my null magic.

17:11.770 --> 17:12.840
Convenient, right?

17:13.220 --> 17:15.380
So, where is this?

17:15.380 --> 17:18.130
That's General Romero's mansion.

17:18.130 --> 17:20.760
The general was always at odds with Bazoar.

17:20.760 --> 17:23.350
He's most likely keeping 
the prince safe there.

17:23.720 --> 17:25.240
That's reassuring, then.

17:25.240 --> 17:27.650
So my older brother is safe?

17:27.650 --> 17:29.040
What a relief.

17:29.040 --> 17:30.490
Thank you so much!

17:30.490 --> 17:32.320
I'm glad I could help.

17:32.690 --> 17:35.480
Then we storm the capital 
first thing tomorrow morning.

17:35.480 --> 17:36.080
Huh?

17:36.080 --> 17:37.370
Hold on a moment!

17:37.370 --> 17:40.400
It's a bit late to ask,
but are you sure that's wise?

17:40.400 --> 17:43.280
You'll be facing a devil and 
an army of over 10,000!

17:43.280 --> 17:45.040
Can you face them by yourself?

17:45.040 --> 17:46.890
I'll manage.

17:46.890 --> 17:49.420
I have powerful allies on my side, after all.

17:52.150 --> 17:54.210
Sango, Kokuyou, Kohaku,

17:54.210 --> 17:57.190
follow Elze and Yae to suppress the army.

17:57.190 --> 18:00.050
Try not to attack anyone
 who surrenders to us.

18:00.430 --> 18:01.570
Yumina, Linze,

18:01.570 --> 18:03.390
provide cover fire with magic and guns.

18:03.780 --> 18:06.350
I'll take down the Demon Lord and the general.

18:10.060 --> 18:12.000
All right, everyone...

18:12.000 --> 18:13.020
Let's go!

18:21.830 --> 18:23.410
So he did come.

18:32.430 --> 18:33.920
Face me, Demon Lord!

18:36.360 --> 18:37.340
That's close!

18:43.370 --> 18:44.870
Accel, Boost!

18:46.970 --> 18:49.720
<i>If I increase the weight of 
my blade with gravity magic</i>

18:49.720 --> 18:52.230
<i>the moment it strikes his head...</i>

18:52.230 --> 18:53.230
Gravity!

19:00.300 --> 19:01.860
Glad that went well.

19:02.240 --> 19:04.690
It might have magic nullification or whatever,

19:04.690 --> 19:07.810
but it doesn't have any effect 
if the spell doesn't target it.

19:07.810 --> 19:11.090
I only applied the spell 
to the blade, after all.

19:11.090 --> 19:11.960
Touya!

19:15.470 --> 19:16.630
Are you all okay?

19:16.630 --> 19:18.690
Yes, we're fine.

19:18.690 --> 19:20.840
Touya-dono! That was impressive!

19:21.180 --> 19:23.230
You defeated it in no time.

19:23.230 --> 19:24.680
That was amazing!

19:24.680 --> 19:26.140
Thanks.

19:26.140 --> 19:28.990
But we still have a few 
finishing touches left to do.

19:30.640 --> 19:32.900
All right, time for your punishment.

19:32.900 --> 19:35.110
Wh-Who are you?!

19:35.110 --> 19:36.910
That was a high-ranking devil!

19:36.910 --> 19:38.990
You shouldn't have been able 
to defeat it on your own!

19:38.990 --> 19:42.480
Well, maybe not, but I just did.

19:43.160 --> 19:45.580
That won't work against me!

19:45.580 --> 19:47.500
Even if you've defeated the Demon Lord,

19:47.500 --> 19:50.220
I still have its magic nullification trait!

19:50.220 --> 19:53.470
So long as I have the Bulwark Bracelet 
and Bracelet of Absorption,

19:53.470 --> 19:54.710
I have nothing to fear!

19:55.100 --> 19:56.040
Storage.

19:58.500 --> 20:00.720
Wh-What is that?

20:01.120 --> 20:03.090
This is a Sludge Slime.

20:03.090 --> 20:06.780
It's a very welcome slime 
that purifies water.

20:06.780 --> 20:07.930
A slime?

20:07.930 --> 20:10.630
It just has one downside.

20:10.630 --> 20:15.400
About an hour after it dies, 
it emits an unbelievably foul odor.

20:15.400 --> 20:20.150
And the Sludge Slime in there 
died about one hour ago, you see.

20:20.150 --> 20:22.110
Y-You don't mean...

20:22.110 --> 20:23.070
Gate.

20:27.330 --> 20:30.160
I-It reeks!

20:27.740 --> 20:31.170
The tempered glass made in 
the Workshop really is amazing.

20:31.170 --> 20:33.560
I can't smell it at all over here.

20:35.260 --> 20:37.040
Hey, you're really hanging in there.

20:37.970 --> 20:38.770
There.

20:53.560 --> 20:55.400
Okay, are you all set?

20:55.400 --> 20:57.360
Yes, please.

20:57.360 --> 20:59.830
Play the video in the sky above the capital.

21:00.170 --> 21:02.070
Understood. Playing now.

21:05.010 --> 21:06.630
Citizens of the capital.

21:06.630 --> 21:10.660
I am the Emperor of Regulus, 
Zephyrus Roa Regulus.

21:11.180 --> 21:15.500
This recent uprising was caused 
by a portion of the army gone mad.

21:15.500 --> 21:18.620
However, the man behind this 
uprising has been captured,

21:18.620 --> 21:21.170
and the capital is once more 
under our control.

21:21.600 --> 21:24.520
As your emperor, I offer my sincere 
apologies for the trouble

21:24.520 --> 21:27.690
caused by not stopping the 
army's recklessness sooner.

21:27.690 --> 21:28.890
I am sorry.

21:30.310 --> 21:31.850
Thank goodness.

21:38.820 --> 21:40.810
Touya! You did it!

21:41.270 --> 21:44.240
I'm glad you're all safe, too. Good work.

21:44.240 --> 21:47.200
Touya, thank you so very much.

21:49.560 --> 21:50.410
What is it?

21:50.410 --> 21:53.240
Um, you kind of smell...

21:53.240 --> 21:54.070
Huh?

21:54.450 --> 21:55.290
Oh...

21:55.290 --> 21:58.960
It's because I touched General Bazoar 
when I was retrieving the bracelets.

21:58.960 --> 22:00.350
Touya...

22:00.350 --> 22:02.960
So you really did use that slime, then?

22:02.960 --> 22:06.680
I'm surprised you came up 
with such a disgusting strategy.

22:06.680 --> 22:08.360
That's a talent in its own right.

22:08.360 --> 22:11.400
Hey, no! It's not like I wanted to do that!

22:11.400 --> 22:13.970
But I had no choice! It was the only way!

22:13.970 --> 22:15.500
Is that really true?

22:15.500 --> 22:17.570
Oh, but you seemed to enjoy it so much.

22:17.570 --> 22:19.150
I mean it!
